  "description": "StreamMark: streaming Markdown rendering for Avalonia, built for AI chat. The core (append-only source buffer, incomplete-markdown repair, segmenter, block model, pacing) and the self-drawn controls (MarkdownView, MarkdownStream, the virtualizing TranscriptView, selection). NativeAOT safe, no WebView. Code highlighting, math and diagrams are the optional TKCode.Arc.StreamMark.TextMate, .RaTeX and .Mermaid plugins.",
